# Git sync + branches

- After every commit on this project: **push** to `origin` immediately (`git push -u` if needed).
- Never leave local commits unpushed unless push fails — then report the error.
- Branches:
  - `main` — stable / defence-ready
  - `develop` — integration
  - `test` — experiments / WIP
- Default feature work: branch from `develop`, merge back to `develop`, then promote to `main` when stable.
- Do not force-push `main` or `develop` unless the user explicitly asks.
